== Effect ==
* Spawns one [[Familiar#Blue Flies|Blue Fly]] from every {{e|Poop}} Isaac destroys.

== Notes ==
* This trinket has a chance to drop from destroying [[Rocks#Polyps|polyps]] in {{s|Corpse}}.
* {{C|???|r}} has the same effect innately, which stacks with {{t|Lil Larva}}.
* {{C|Jacob and Esau}} share the effect among both characters if at least one of them is holding it.

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Mom's Box}} / {{t|Lil Larva|r}} / {{A|Golden Trinket}}: Each effect/trinket copy stacks granting one additional blue fly from destroyed poops per stack.

